  "facts": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "The Markham Museum is an open‑air village that hosts over 30 historic buildings, many of which were carefully moved from around town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/markham-museum-markham/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Markham’s name comes from an English place name meaning “settlement near the boundary stream.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/markham-95582"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historically, the area that is now Markham grew around logging, agriculture, and its proximity to major transportation routes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/markham-95582"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The museum’s mission is to help visitors understand how local history has shaped the present, celebrating community resilience and ingenuity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/markham-museum-markham/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Markham’s fertile soils and climate patterns are influenced by the Pacific Ocean, supporting its historic orchard industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/markham-95582"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Markham Museum’s collection includes a cider mill that once processed the town’s apple harvest, reflecting the area’s orchard heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
